    {
     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: coordinating at work",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "工作中遇到「项目管理」的问题，你会先跟谁商量？",
       "alumno": "If a problem related to «project organisation» comes up at work, who would you talk to first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我查了几份材料，发现不同来源的说法并不完全一样。",
       "alumno": "I have looked at several materials and found that the sources don't entirely agree.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你打算怎样核实？",
       "alumno": "How do you plan to check it?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我会先比较出处，再看论据是否一致。",
       "alumno": "I'll first compare the sources, and then see whether the arguments match.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果核实后仍有差异呢？",
       "alumno": "What if the differences remain after checking?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "那就说明不同观点，并把证据的局限写清楚。",
       "alumno": "Then I will set out the different views and make clear the limits of the evidence.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: coordinating at work",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "处理工作中的「项目管理」，需要明确分工和时间安排。",
       "alumno": "Dealing with «project organisation» at work requires clarifying responsibilities and timelines.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "遇到变化时，及时沟通通常比等到最后补救更有效。",
       "alumno": "When circumstances change, communicating in time is usually more effective than patching things up at the last minute.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果只凭个人印象，容易忽略其他情况；因此要核对材料，并说明判断依据。",
       "alumno": "If you rely only on personal impressions, you may overlook other cases; that's why you should check the materials and explain the basis for your judgement.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "组织短文时，可以先提出观点，再用事实或例子支持它。",
       "alumno": "When organising a short text, you can first put forward a view and then support it with facts or examples.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
